lance (including premiums for optional credit insurance) is not paid in full within the promotional period. Valid 12\\/12\\/16-1\\/8\\/17. \\n*With credit approval for qualifying purchases made on The Home Depot or EXPO Design Center Consumer Credit Card. APR: 17.99% \\u2013 26.99%. Minimum interest charge: $2. See card agreement for details including APR applicable to you. Offer valid for consumer accounts in good standing; 6 months everyday credit offer is subject to change without notice; ask an Associate for details.\",\"image_file_name\":null,\"image_alt\":\"20% OFF SPECIAL ORDER CABINETS see store associate for details. PLUS, UP TO 24 MONTH FINANCING. Valid 12\\/12\\/16 - 1\\/8\\/17.\",\"status\":\"Pending\",\"compiled_html\":\"\",\"creator_id\":81}','81','https://vacoda.io/api/banner','207.11.1.162','2016-12-28 03:35:26',NULL),
